<Page title="Cookie policy" kicker="Legal" description="Grand Tour does not set cookies or store anything on your device." citations={['https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/ALL/?uri=CELEX:32002L0058', 'https://ico.org.uk/for-organisations/direct-marketing-and-privacy-and-electronic-communications/guide-to-pecr/cookies-and-similar-technologies/', 'https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/privacy-policy']} lede="Grand Tour does not set cookies and does not store anything on your device, so there is no cookie banner: there is nothing to consent to.">
  <h2>How visits are counted</h2>
  <p>We count page views with Vercel Web Analytics, which, according to Vercel, works without cookies: a visitor is identified by a hash of the incoming request that is discarded after 24 hours. Nothing is written to or read from your browser’s storage. See our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  <h2>Other storage</h2>
  <p>This site does not use local storage, session storage, fingerprinting scripts, advertising pixels or social-media plugins. Fonts and images are served from our own domain.</p>
  <h2>Sites we link to</h2>
  <p>Operator websites, the Tourground directory and the sources we cite have their own cookie policies.</p>
  <h2>If this changes</h2>
  <p>If we ever add a cookie or similar technology that is not strictly necessary, we will ask for your consent first where the law requires it, and update this page.</p>
  <h2>Sources</h2>
  <ul>
